{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年45歲的名模熊黛林（Lynn）與郭可頌於2016年結婚，育有一對雙胞胎女兒Kaylor和Lyvia，一家四口十分幸福。</p><p>婚後一度淡出幕前做少奶奶的她，近年積極復出衝事業，接綜藝兼做直播帶貨。</p><p>一向恩愛的二人，近日在慶祝結婚10周年旅行期間，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:21:18.873868+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:20.664581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:20.664581+00:00","content_hash":"6dc61196d3d1263e08e56ad770ebe12cafd8947aaa3879f219fb9a83559feef2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}